<p>Anyway, since Gemini just makes up imdb IDs, I&#8217;m instead resorting to using the imdb data dump &#8212; when I get &#8220;Alan Alda&#8221; back from the LLM, I then look up the name in the imdb data dump database (that I have locally) and use that instead.  If the name is spelt differently there than what Gemini returned?  Well, them&#8217;s the breaks.</p>
<p>So this is totally a toy, but it&#8217;s kinda useful anyway.</p>
